## 3. Filament v4 Patterns

### Use Filament v4 Syntax
```php
// ✅ CORRECT - Filament v4 uses Schema::schema()
use Filament\Schemas\Schema;

public static function form(Schema $schema): Schema
{
    return $schema->schema([
        Forms\Components\TextInput::make('name'),
        Forms\Components\Select::make('client_id')
            ->relationship('client', 'name')
            ->required(),
    ]);
}

// ❌ WRONG - Old Filament v3 syntax
public static function form(Form $form): Form
{
    return $form->schema([...]);
}
```

### Leverage Filament Lifecycle Hooks
```php
// ✅ CORRECT - Use lifecycle hooks for business logic
protected function mutateFormDataBeforeCreate(array $data): array
{
    // Auto-generate order number
    $data['number'] = Order::max('number') + 1;
    $data['user_id'] = auth()->id();
    
    return $data;
}

protected function afterCreate(): void
{
    // Send notification after order created
    $this->record->client->notify(new OrderCreated($this->record));
}

// ❌ WRONG - Don't bypass Filament hooks
public function store(Request $request)
{
    $order = Order::create($request->all()); // Missing business logic
}
```

### Use Filament Actions & Bulk Actions
```php
// ✅ CORRECT - Define actions on table
public static function table(Table $table): Table
{
    return $table
        ->actions([
            Tables\Actions\EditAction::make(),
            Tables\Actions\DeleteAction::make(),
            Tables\Actions\Action::make('confirm')
                ->icon('heroicon-o-check-circle')
                ->requiresConfirmation()
                ->action(fn (Order $record) => $record->update(['is_confirmed' => true])),
        ])
        ->bulkActions([
            Tables\Actions\BulkActionGroup::make([
                Tables\Actions\DeleteBulkAction::make(),
                Tables\Actions\BulkAction::make('mark_delivered')
                    ->action(fn (Collection $records) => $records->each->update(['is_delivered' => true])),
            ]),
        ]);
}
```

