## 12. Performance Guidelines

### Cache Expensive Calculations
```php
// ✅ CORRECT - Cache tenant-specific data
use Illuminate\Support\Facades\Cache;

public function getTenantSettings(): array
{
    return Cache::remember(
        "tenant.{$this->id}.settings",
        now()->addHours(24),
        fn () => $this->settings
    );
}

// Invalidate cache when updated
public function updateSettings(array $settings): void
{
    $this->update(['settings' => $settings]);
    Cache::forget("tenant.{$this->id}.settings");
}
```

### Queue Long-Running Tasks
```php
// ✅ CORRECT - Queue expensive operations
use App\Jobs\GenerateOrderReport;

public function generateReport(Order $order): void
{
    GenerateOrderReport::dispatch($order)
        ->onQueue('reports');
}

// Make jobs tenant-aware
class GenerateOrderReport implements ShouldQueue
{
    use Queueable;
    
    public function __construct(public Order $order) {}
    
    public function handle(): void
    {
        tenancy()->initialize($this->order->tenant);
        
        // Generate report...
    }
}
```

